ion is refused, not rounded up to default.\n  timeout: str(required=False)\n  merged_steps: include('merged_steps')\n\n---\nuser_story:\n  story: str()\n  scenario_id: str()\n  merge_date: str(required=False)\n\n---\n# All three blocks are optional in shape; a scenario with no step at all\n# is one no test can execute, but that check is left to `build tests` —\n# which blocks are needed depends on the behaviour, not the document.\nmerged_steps:\n  given: list(any(str(), map(str())), required=False)\n  when: list(any(str(), map(str())), required=False)\n  then: list(any(str(), map(str())), required=False)\n","numLines":88,"startLine":1,"totalLines":88}}}
